<div class="staff-hero"><div><span class="staff-kicker">PROFIL TOKO</span><h1><?= html_escape($store['display_name']) ?></h1><p>Toko ini terhubung ke kegiatan UMKM: <?= html_escape($store['business_name']) ?>.</p></div><div class="staff-page-actions"><?php if (in_array($user['role_code'],array('superadmin','admin_dinas','admin_kecamatan'),TRUE) && !$store['is_demo']): ?><a href="<?= site_url('pengelola/registri/'.$store['business_id']) ?>">Profil UMKM →</a><?php endif; ?><?php if ($store['status']==='active'): ?><a href="<?= site_url('toko/'.$store['slug']) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lihat toko ↗</a><?php endif; ?></div></div><?php if($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?= html_escape($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><?php if($this->input->get('tersimpan')): ?><div class="alert alert-success">Profil toko berhasil disimpan.</div><?php endif; ?><section class="staff-panel catalog-panel"><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="<?= $this->security->get_csrf_token_name() ?>" value="<?= $this->security->get_csrf_hash() ?>"><label>Nama toko<input class="form-control" name="display_name" maxlength="190" value="<?= html_escape($store['display_name']) ?>" required></label><label>Deskripsi toko<textarea class="form-control" name="description" maxlength="5000" rows="5"><?= html_escape($store['description']) ?></textarea></label><div class="catalog-columns"><label>Nomor WhatsApp<input class="form-control" name="whatsapp" type="tel" maxlength="20" value="<?= html_escape($store['whatsapp_e164']) ?>" required></label><label>Nama kontak<input class="form-control" name="contact_label" maxlength="120" value="<?= html_escape($store['contact_label']) ?>" placeholder="Admin toko"></label></div><h2>Jam layanan</h2><p>Kosongkan kedua jam bila belum ingin menampilkan hari tersebut. Centang tutup untuk menampilkan hari libur.</p><div class="store-hours-grid"><?php foreach($days as $day=>$name): $h=isset($hours[$day])?$hours[$day]:NULL; ?><div class="store-hours-row"><strong><?= $name ?></strong><label>Buka<input class="form-control" type="time" name="open_<?= $day ?>" value="<?= $h && $h['opens_at']?html_escape(substr($h['opens_at'],0,5)):'' ?>"></label><label>Tutup<input class="form-control" type="time" name="close_<?= $day ?>" value="<?= $h && $h['closes_at']?html_escape(substr($h['closes_at'],0,5)):'' ?>"></label><label class="catalog-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="closed_<?= $day ?>" value="1" <?= $h && $h['is_closed']?'checked':'' ?>> Libur</label></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Simpan profil toko</button></form></section>
<section class="staff-panel catalog-panel"><h2>Kategori toko</h2><p><?= $category_rows?html_escape(implode(', ',array_column($category_rows,'name'))):'Belum ada kategori.' ?></p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<?= site_url('pengelola/kategori').'?store='.(int)$store['id'] ?>">Atur kategori →</a></section>
<?php if(in_array($user['role_code'],array('superadmin','admin_dinas','admin_kecamatan'),TRUE)): ?><section class="staff-panel catalog-panel"><h2>Produk toko</h2><p>Produk baru akan terhubung ke toko ini dan disimpan sebagai draf.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<?= site_url('pengelola/produk-baru').'?store_id='.(int)$store['id'] ?>">+ Tambah produk untuk toko ini</a></section><?php endif; ?>
<?php if(in_array($user['role_code'],array('superadmin','admin_dinas'),TRUE) && $store['status']==='draft'): ?><section class="staff-panel catalog-panel"><h2>Aktifkan toko</h2><p>NIB resmi: <?= $has_verified_nib?'sudah diperiksa':'belum diperiksa' ?>. Kategori: <?= $category_rows?'tersedia':'belum tersedia' ?>. Catat hasil kunjungan sebelum toko tampil di etalase.</p><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('pengelola/toko/'.$store['id'].'/aktifkan') ?>"><input type="hidden" name="<?= $this->security->get_csrf_token_name() ?>" value="<?= $this->security->get_csrf_hash() ?>"><label>Tanggal kunjungan<input class="form-control" type="date" name="visit_date" max="<?= date('Y-m-d') ?>" required></label><label>Hasil pemeriksaan<textarea class="form-control" name="findings" minlength="20" maxlength="2000" rows="4" required></textarea></label><label class="catalog-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="checked" value="1" required> Saya telah memeriksa NIB, toko, dan hasil kunjungan.</label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" <?= !$has_verified_nib || !$category_rows?'disabled':'' ?>>Aktifkan toko</button></form></section><?php endif; ?>
